Hi Lilo,

The max/mean observations in the summary refer to the number of repeated samples per site, not the number of times you observed an animal. It appears that at every site, you sampled 12 times (i.e., your y-matrix has 12 columns). If you had some missing values in the y-matrix, the mean would be lower.

I also find this wording confusing!

Ken

